# Keep the build context small.
#
# Three Dockerfiles share this file and they need different things:
#   ./Dockerfile                  builds the frontend from source, so it needs
#                                 cmd/sysmon/frontend/{src,package*.json}
#   test/integration/Dockerfile   expects cmd/sysmon/frontend/dist prebuilt
#   test/desktop/Dockerfile       installs the Cinnamon applet, so it needs
#                                 extensions/
#
# So the frontend source and the extensions stay IN the context and only
# genuinely useless things are excluded.
.git
.github/
bin/
dist/

cmd/sysmon/frontend/node_modules/
cmd/sysmon/frontend/test-results/
cmd/sysmon/frontend/playwright-report/

docs/
coverage.out
coverage.html
